    <string name="about_version_with_code">Version %1$s (%2$d)</string>
    <string name="about_tagline">An open-source tool for hiding files inside images</string>
    <string name="about_description">Supports PNG, JPEG and WebP carriers, ZIP compression, AES-256-GCM encryption and directory structures. PNG output without advanced features remains fully compatible with the original Image Folder tpWj format.</string>
    <string name="about_archives">ZIP, 7z, TAR, GZ, BZ2, XZ and RAR files in extraction results can be unpacked in-app (ZIP/7z passwords and split archives are supported; RAR supports unencrypted RAR5 including solid/multi-volume and non-solid RAR4, but not RAR passwords or solid RAR4).</string>
