    <string name="about_section_privacy">Privacy &amp; trust</string>
    <string name="about_privacy_local">All packing and decryption happen on this device; no files are uploaded.</string>
    <string name="about_privacy_network">The app has no network permission and collects no analytics or crash data. Check for updates only opens GitHub in your browser.</string>
    <string name="about_privacy_storage">All files access is optional and only used to browse ordinary folders the system picker cannot open. The app still uploads nothing.</string>
    <string name="about_privacy_open">The code is open source under GPL-3.0 and the data format is documented. Encryption protects the content, but does not hide the fact that an image contains hidden data.</string>
